# The legs' BUILT ARMS. Each is over 100 MB and none of them is a record: an
# arm is rebuilt from a source tree by build_ipm_time.sh / build_layout_time.sh,
# and PROVENANCE.md says how each recorded run's arms were produced. What the
# repository keeps is the logs, the probe sources and the provenance -- every
# log's build header carries the arm binaries' sha256 and mtime, which is what
# ties a row to the image that produced it.
ipm_base
ipm_head
layout_base
layout_head
